I'll crush him Little Yugi can try to reason
with his friend Joey all he wants He'll

246
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:52,017
never break the power
of my Millennium Rod And

247
00:14:52,100 --> 00:14:55,980
soon victory will be
mine Excellent dueling,

248
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:58,600
my mind slave It's almost over.

249
00:14:58,940 --> 00:15:00,160
Please wake up!

250
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:03,657
Haven't you realized that
your friend isn't coming back?

251
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:08,200
You're dealing with me now, and I'm
about to take everything away from you.

252
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:12,414
You've got to snap out of this, Chewie.

253
00:15:12,940 --> 00:15:14,058
Time's running out.

254
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:16,260
This trap card may help.

255
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:17,735
Nothing can save you.

256
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,857
Well, I'll place one card face down.

257
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:20,957
And now...

258
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:24,180
Beast of Guilford, attack
his Panther Warrior!

259
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:28,680
This is for your own good, Joey!

260
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:34,477
You've fallen right into
my trap, little Yugi,

261
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:37,037
and your foolish mistake
will cost you dearly.

262
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:39,217
As soon as your beast
attacks, you're done.

263
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:40,960
Don't be so sure about that!

264
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:44,640
Guilfer, roast his panther
with your flame attack!

265
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:46,810
Rawr!

266
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:48,420
Reveal my skull dice!

267
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:54,380
And just to make sure my move works,
I'll add this card, my Graceful Dice.

268
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:55,920
Stop his attack, now!

269
00:15:57,740 --> 00:16:00,537
Graceful Dice will increase my monster's

270
00:16:00,620 --> 00:16:03,385
attack points according
to the roll of the die,

271
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:07,200
while Skull Dice reduces
your monster's strength.

272
00:16:08,460 --> 00:16:11,120
And I'm feeling very lucky today.

273
00:16:11,420 --> 00:16:13,040
Guess again. What?

274
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:16,420
Now I reveal my magic card, Dispel.

275
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:19,840
I'll use it to destroy your Graceful Dice.

276
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,857
Sorry to disappoint you, Merrick,

277
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:28,557
but now you can't raise the attack
points of your panther warrior.

278
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:30,717
But I can still weaken your monster.

279
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,880
Go Skulldice!

280
00:16:35,140 --> 00:16:36,120
A two!

281
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:40,240
Sorry, that only cuts my
monster's attack strength in half.

282
00:16:40,900 --> 00:16:42,280
My panther's doomed.

283
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,040
It's down there!

284
00:16:53,260 --> 00:16:55,340
Time to crash this party, now!

285
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,020
I'm scared, guys.

286
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:01,177
Everything's gonna be fine, Serenity.

287
00:17:01,260 --> 00:17:02,090
He's right.

288
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:05,005
With me on your side,
you can't lose, Serenity.

289
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,257
We'll get Joey out of here,

290
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:08,857
and pretty soon you'll be
watching him duel in the finals.

291
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:09,800
Thanks, Mai.

292
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,317
Hey, something's going on over there.

293
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,860
It looks like a duel.

294
00:17:15,140 --> 00:17:19,375
You may have destroyed my Panther
Warrior, but you're about to lose this

295
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,540
In just over five minutes,

296
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:25,717
you'll sink to the bottom
of the sea while I acquire

297
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,760
your Egyptian God card and
your Millennium puzzle!

298
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:32,737
This is my last chance to get
through to Joey and save us both!

299
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:35,320
Yugi only has 1,000 life points left!

300
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:39,992
One more major attack by Joey, and that
anchor's gonna take him down, Seto!

301
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:45,380
But if that timer runs out first, Yugi
and Wheeler will both be fish food. Huh?

302
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:52,720
Hey, Joey! Yugi!

303
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:55,540
They found us!

304
00:17:55,940 --> 00:17:57,200
Help us, guys!

305
00:17:58,140 --> 00:17:58,970
Taya?

306
00:17:59,053 --> 00:17:59,883
What's going on?

307
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:01,960
Don't get any closer!

308
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:03,928
What are you talking about?

309
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,140
Check it out.

310
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,680
If we try to save Taya,

311
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:10,817
that rare hunter will release
the crate hanging above her head.

312
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:13,018
It's too dangerous to risk, Tristan.

313
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,677
Why would they want to do that?

314
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:18,117
So we don't break up Joey and Yugi's duel.

315
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,480
That's just sick.

316
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,602
If you think that's it, Tristan,

317
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:24,935
just look at the dueling
setup these guys put together.

318
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,440
These guys don't mess around.

319
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:30,740
Man, what's the deal with
the anchor and the chains?

320
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:35,137
And how come Yugi and Joey are
dueling in the first place?

321
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:38,137
Come on, will someone please
tell me what's going on?

322
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:41,520
Your friend, Wheeler,
is on their side. Huh?

323
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:43,480
Wait, whose side?

324
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:48,117
Somehow Joey lost his mind, and now
he's dueling on the rare hunter's side.

325
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:50,717
Whoever loses gets pulled
to the bottom of the sea.

326
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:51,630
That's insane.

327
00:18:51,713 --> 00:18:53,020
We gotta stop this.

328
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:55,400
But we can't. My brother.

329
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:59,880
I can't let Serenity see Joey like this.

330
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:01,275
She'll be devastated.

331
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:05,100
Serenity, please don't
take your bandages off yet.

332
00:19:06,140 --> 00:19:09,740
Listen, you have to trust
me on this one, okay?

333
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:13,039
Serenity lives for her big brother.

334
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:16,297
If her first sight is Joey
possessed by some evil nutcase,

335
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,027
she would never get over it.

336
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:19,480
Poor Joey.

337
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:21,380
Don't you worry.

338
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:24,180
If anyone can save Joey, Yugi can.

339
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:26,320
The end is near, Yugi.

340
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:30,129
I could just let the timer run
out, destroying you and Joey.

341
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:32,797
But out dueling you will
be so much more fun.

342
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:36,517
And now, all of your little friends
are here to witness your demise!

343
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:38,300
So, here goes!

344
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:40,760
Meteor of Destruction!

345
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:43,120
Excellent work, my mind slave!

346
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:45,917
That's just the card we need to win!

347
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,160
Now, play it and win me that puzzle!

348
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:51,380
And destroy your best friend!

349
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:57,000
One more move and you'll be gone
for good while I rule the world!
